cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Mondegreen: private glossaries as hard phonetic constraints for local ASR correction"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: NagaYu
repository-code: "https://github.com/NagaYu/mondegreen"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-23"
keywords:
  - speech recognition
  - error correction
  - japanese
  - phonetics
  - constrained decoding
  - on-device
abstract: >-
  Mondegreen compiles a private glossary into a phonetic index and expresses ASR
  correction as a span replacement that is structurally unable to leave the
  glossary or to exceed a weighted phonetic edit-distance bound. It targets the
  case where the audio cannot be uploaded, and treats the rate at which
  already-correct text is broken as the primary metric.
